cff-version: "4.0.1"
message: "If you use BioSignal-FM in your research, please cite it as below."
title: "BioSignal-FM: A Unified Foundation Model for Surface Biosignals"
abstract: >-
  BioSignal-FM is a transformer-based foundation model architecture for
  self-supervised learning on four heterogeneous surface biosignal
  modalities (EMG, ECG, EEG, fNIRS), targeting unified cross-modality
  representation learning. The pipeline, statistical evaluation
  framework, and pre-registered analysis plan (H1-H3) are complete and
  verified; SSL pretraining on real data and the cross-modal transfer
  hypothesis (H2) are not yet empirically validated — see the paper
  draft and pre-registration for the current, honestly-reported status.
